ACT AT PARKS, EXPERIENCES AND PRODUCTS WAS PARTIALLY OFFSET BY A POSITIVE IMPACT AT MEDIA NETWORKS IN QUARTER.CURRENT QUARTER CHARGES INCLUDED $4,953 MILLION OF IMPAIRMENTS OF GOODWILL AND INTANGIBLE ASSETS AT INTERNATIONAL CHANNELS BUSINESS.MEDIA NETWORKS REVENUES FOR QUARTER DECREASED 2% TO $6.6 BILLION.CABLE NETWORKS REVENUES FOR QUARTER DECREASED 10% TO $4.0 BILLION.DISNEY+ PAID SUBSCRIBERS AT QUARTER-END 57.5 MILLION.STUDIO ENTERTAINMENT REVENUES FOR THE QUARTER DECREASED 55% TO $1.7 BILLION.PARKS, EXPERIENCES AND PRODUCTS REVENUES FOR QUARTER DECREASED 85% TO $1.0 BILLION.DURING THE CURRENT QUARTER, CO RECORDED RESTRUCTURING AND IMPAIRMENT CHARGES TOTALING $5,047 MILLION.'}{'symbol': 'WU', 'date': '2020-08-05 18:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Western Union Reports Second Quarter Results', 'text': 'WESTERN UNION REPORTS SECOND QUARTER RESULTS.Q2 GAAP EARNINGS PER SHARE $0.39.Q2 REVENUE $1.1 BILLION VERSUS REFINITIV IBES ESTIMATE OF $1.08 BILLION.Q2 ADJUSTED EARNINGS PER SHARE $0.41.Q2 EARNINGS PER SHARE ESTIMATE $0.35 -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.WESTERN UNION - QTRLY CONSUMER-TO-CONSUMER (C2C) REVENUES DECLINED 12% ON A REPORTED BASIS, OR 11% CONSTANT CURRENCY, WHILE TRANSACTIONS DECLINED 8%.WESTERN UNION - DUE TO MACRO-ECONOMIC UNCERTAINTY COVID-19 IS CAUSING, CO MAINTAINED DECISION TO FORGO A FULL YEAR 2020 FINANCIAL OUTLOOK AT THIS TIME.'}{'symbol': 'WYNN', 'date': '2020-08-05 19:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Wynn Resorts Says There Was Some Pent-Up Demand In Las Vegas, California When Co Opened In June - Conf Call', 'text': 'WYNN RESORTS CEO SAYS THERE WAS SOME PENT-UP DEMAND IN LAS VEGAS, IN PARTICULAR FROM CALIFORNIA WHEN CO OPENED IN JUNE - CONF CALL.WYNN RESORTS CEO - "AS THE VIRUS BEGAN TO SPIKE IN OUR KEY DRIVE END MARKETS IN CALIFORNIA AND ARIZONA, WE SAW A DOWNTICK IN RESERVATIONS, ROUGHLY 25% HERE AT WYNN AFTER THE FOURTH OF JULY".WYNN RESORTS CFO SAYS EXPECTS TO BE BREAKEVEN TO SLIGHTLY EBITDA POSITIVE OVER NEXT FEW MONTHS.WYNN RESORTS CFO SAYS BUSINESS VOLUMES REMAINED SUBDUED IN MACAU THROUGHOUT THE QUARTER DUE TO ONGOING TRAVEL RESTRICTIONS IN THE REGION.WYNN RESORTS EXEC SAYS OPERATING EXPENSES FOR MACAU AT CURRENT REVENUE LEVELS IS A $1.5 MILLION TO $2 MILLION PER DAY BURN RATE.'}{'symbol': 'WYNN', 'date': '2020-08-05 18:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Wynn Resorts, Limited Reports Second Quarter 2020 Results', 'text': 'WYNN RESORTS, LIMITED REPORTS SECOND QUARTER 2020 RESULTS.Q2 ADJUSTED LOSS PER SHARE $6.14.Q2 LOSS PER SHARE $5.97.Q2 EARNINGS PER SHARE ESTIMATE $-4.98 -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.OPERATING REVENUES FROM WYNN MACAU WERE $11.9 MILLION FOR Q2 OF 2020.OPERATING REVENUES FROM OUR LAS VEGAS OPERATIONS WERE $64.9 MILLION FOR Q2 OF 2020.OPERATING REVENUES WERE $85.7 MILLION FOR Q2 OF 2020, A DECREASE OF 94.8%, OR $1.57 BILLION, FROM $1.66 BILLION FOR Q2 OF 2019.Q2 EARNINGS PER SHARE VIEW $-4.98, REVENUE VIEW $212.2 MILLION -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.CASH AND CASH EQUIVALENTS AND RESTRICTED CASH AS OF JUNE 30, 2020 TOTALED $3.80 BILLION.'}{'symbol': 'ZBH', 'date': '2020-08-05 08:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Zimmer Biomet Reports Q2 Adj EPS Of $0.05', 'text': 'ZIMMER BIOMET ANNOUNCES SECOND QUARTER 2020 FINANCIAL RESULTS.Q2 ADJUSTED EARNINGS PER SHARE $0.05.Q2 LOSS PER SHARE $1.00.Q2 SALES FELL 38.3 PERCENT TO $1.226 BILLION.Q2 REVENUE ESTIMATE $909.4 MILLION -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.Q2 EARNINGS PER SHARE ESTIMATE $-0.73 -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.NOT PROVIDING FULL-YEAR FINANCIAL GUIDANCE AT THIS TIME.'}